#   (1) run-to-run @ 2 并发:  scores_A.npz == scores_B.npz  sha 69c60c4b327c1a3b...  (种子 99, 非家族)
#   (2) 跨负载(solo -> 2 并发): 重训 (T0,s42,202506) 得 2d1d30ffc502... == 独跑时的存档  MATCH=YES
#   (3) 已交付 OOF 未变: de3f12028cd9c7c4... UNCHANGED=YES
